{"synopsis":"“—Apakah ini… neraka?”\n\nPernah menjadi yang terkuat di benua, Yaemori Bakuto dikhianati dan dibunuh oleh sekutu-sekutunya sendiri. Ia terbangun dan terlahir kembali sebagai mahasiswa ringkih dari keluarga bangsawan, sosok yang dibuang oleh klannya dan dirundung di sekolah. Dengan tetap memegang teguh harga diri dari kehidupan masa lalunya, Bakuto mulai berlatih kembali, bersumpah untuk membalas dendam dan membidik posisi puncak sekali lagi. Jiwa terkuat dalam tubuh terlemah; pembalasan dendam yang kejam pun dimulai.","alternative_title":"一族の落ちこぼれは元大陸最強者","author":"Goose Five","artist":"黑风寨大当家","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"b99154e6-36cc-4c45-ad64-39af959aad09","number":"26","chapter":"26","title":"Chapter 26","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ec162d0a-d2fe-4bd3-b2c5-1dff6a9ec3c8","number":"25","chapter":"25","title":"Chapter 25","date":"2026-08-02","released":"2026-08-02","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"dc84d594-e93b-4049-97de-876ffd1ab055","number":"24","chapter":"24","title":"Chapter 24","date":"2026-08-01","released":"2026-08-01","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"407bd77d-c083-439e-ad56-3b2a30369445","number":"23","chapter":"23","title":"Chapter 23","date":"2026-06-29","released":"2026-06-29","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"d441c7eb-43cc-4d4d-8f7f-90538c2030eb","number":"22","chapter":"22","title":"Chapter 22","date":"2026-06-22","released":"2026-06-22","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"566eb9f7-276c-401b-a30b-d0f1569963fe","number":"21","chapter":"21","title":"Chapter 21","date":"2026-06-18","released":"2026-06-18","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"1392db0b-0ff6-4291-8457-06057e35f28f","number":"20","chapter":"20","title":"Chapter 20","date":"2026-06-14","released":"2026-06-14","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"998a6d1a-367d-4ec4-a5eb-232ad0e844af","number":"19","chapter":"19","title":"Chapter 19","date":"2026-06-14","released":"2026-06-14","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"e596ec1b-5006-4e3d-81ba-d7a62f5ea574","number":"18","chapter":"18","title":"C